Subject: [PATCH 49/51] B70-K2: per-token int8 act quant folded into the
 producers (B70_I8_PRODUCER_QUANT, default off)

HC down finish/hc_silu -> HC up, HC gate mix -> in_proj_qkvz/qkv_proj, GDN gated
RMSNorm -> out_proj, attn sigmoid gate -> o_proj emit bf16 + int8 + fp32 scale
(XPU scaled_int8_quant rule, bitwise); W1 apply takes them and runs the K1
b70_w8a8_gemm (M<=64) or W1 GEMM. CPU tests: bitwise vs the unfused path.
